&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a63231fec7325bd600fce42" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 13:26:50 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.rand.org/pubs/external_publications/EP71429.html</guid></item><item><title>可控混乱：继乌克兰之后与俄罗斯实现适度和平的艰难之路</title><link>https://www.rand.org/pubs/external_publications/EP71428.html</link><description>&lt;p class="desc"&gt;乌克兰战争最终将会结束，但很可能会以停火的方式结束，这会让俄罗斯、欧洲和美国陷入无休止的、低级的、混乱的对抗之中。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a63231fec7325bd600fce42" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 13:26:50 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.rand.org/pubs/external_publications/EP71428.html</guid></item><item><title>欧洲可以帮助乌克兰和俄罗斯回到谈判桌</title><link>https://www.rand.org/pubs/commentary/2026/07/europe-could-help-get-ukraine-and-russia-to-the-negotiating.html</link><description>&lt;img height="90" src="https://www.rand.org/content/rand/pubs/commentary/2026/07/europe-could-help-get-ukraine-and-russia-to-the-negotiating/_jcr_content/par/teaser.crop.160x90.cm.jpeg/1784933077745.jpeg" width="160" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p class="desc"&gt;只有外交才能结束这场战争。但美国主导的进程是断断续续且不一致的。由于特朗普高级官员仍然专注于伊朗问题，欧洲各国政府有机会采取主动。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a63231fec7325bd600fce42" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 13:26:50 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.rand.org/pubs/commentary/2026/07/europe-could-help-get-ukraine-and-russia-to-the-negotiating.html</guid></item></channel></rss>